This product is an ESP-IDF port of the Amazon Kinesis Video Streams WebRTC
SDK C (https://github.com/awslabs/amazon-kinesis-video-streams-webrtc-sdk-c).
The upstream SDK is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy
of the License is available in the LICENSE file at the top of this repository.

The upstream SDK is included as a git submodule at
amazon-kinesis-video-streams-webrtc-sdk-c/ and a small set of platform patches
is applied to it via git am. See patches/README.md for the patch ledger.

Bundled third-party components
------------------------------

This product also includes software developed by third parties, included as
git submodules. Each is distributed under its own license; see the individual
LICENSE file inside each submodule for the full text.

  cisco/libsrtp                       (BSD-3-Clause)
    components/libsrtp2/libsrtp/

  warmcat/libwebsockets               (MIT)
    components/libwebsockets/libwebsockets/

  sctplab/usrsctp (via vikramdattu/usrsctp fork with ESP-specific patches)
                                      (BSD-3-Clause)
    components/esp_usrsctp/usrsctp/

  espressif/esp-hosted-mcu            (Apache-2.0)
    components/esp_hosted/

The component manifests under components/*/idf_component.yml may also pull in
additional Espressif components from the ESP Component Registry
(https://components.espressif.com); each registry component carries its own
license metadata.
